id=measure-oid-quoted
class=derivation
found=after 0.3.0 shipped, 2026-10-15
fixed=0.3.1
test=test/01_bloat_cause.sql
detail=bloat_cause_measure() built the pgstattuple read with format('%L', oid), which quotes the oid,
       so pgstattuple received the string '19223' and looked up a relation named 19223: ERROR:
       relation "19223" does not exist. The cast is %s::regclass, which is the oid itself and does
       no name lookup. test/01 calls the measure and reads its result, so a quoted oid fails the
       file.
